          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>SonoVive™ </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement designed to support hearing wellness and cognitive health. Its reported ingredients include herbal extracts and other compounds studied for their potential roles in brain function and nervous-system activity. However, the exact formula should be verified against the product label, and the benefits of the finished supplement have not been established by strong clinical evidence.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Hearing Wellness –</b>&nbsp;SonoVive is promoted for people interested in maintaining hearing wellness as they age. Its reported ingredients have been studied for various biological effects, but there is insufficient evidence to confirm that SonoVive improves hearing sensitivity or reverses hearing loss.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Promotes Cognitive Wellness–&nbsp;</b>Some reported ingredients, such as Bacopa monnieri and Ginkgo biloba, have been investigated for their potential effects on memory and cognitive performance. Results vary, and these ingredients should not be assumed to improve memory in every user.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Normal Nervous-System Function –</b>&nbsp;The nervous system helps the brain process information received through the senses, including sound. SonoVive's reported ingredients are associated with research into neurological processes, but there is no established evidence that the supplement improves auditory nerve function.</div></div><div><div><b><br></b></div></div><div><div><b>✅Provides Ingredients Studied for Antioxidant Activity– </b>Certain plant compounds are studied for their antioxidant properties. Antioxidants help protect cells from oxidative stress under normal biological conditions. However, the presence of such ingredients does not prove that SonoVive protects hearing structures or prevents age-related hearing changes.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports General Brain Health –</b>&nbsp;SonoVive is marketed toward people interested in cognitive and neurological wellness. Some of its reported ingredients are commonly included in brain-support supplements, although the effectiveness of individual ingredients varies and cannot be used to establish the effectiveness of the complete formula.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅May Complement a Healthy Lifestyle –</b>&nbsp;A balanced diet, regular physical activity, adequate sleep, and management of health conditions can contribute to overall well-being. A dietary supplement, if appropriate, may form part of a broader wellness routine, but it cannot replace healthy habits or medical care.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Encourages Attention to Hearing Health –&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>Learning about hearing wellness can encourage people to take practical steps to protect their ears, such as limiting exposure to loud sounds and using appropriate hearing protection. These measures are more directly relevant to preventing noise-related hearing damage than relying on an unproven supplement.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers a Convenient Supplement Format –</b>&nbsp;For people who prefer supplements in capsule form, SonoVive may provide a convenient way to consume its listed ingredients according to the manufacturer's directions. Check the current label for the serving size, warnings, allergens, and ingredient quantities.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports a Broader Wellness Routine –</b>&nbsp;Healthy hearing and cognitive function depend on many factors, including age, general health, noise exposure, and certain medications. SonoVive should not be considered a stand-alone solution for hearing concerns or cognitive difficulties.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Provides an Opportunity to Review Nutritional Choices –</b>&nbsp;Examining a supplement's ingredients can help consumers make more informed decisions about their wellness routines. Reviewing the scientific evidence, checking for medication interactions, and discussing supplements with a qualified healthcare professional are important steps before use.</span></div></div><div><div><br></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
